6284	{"artifactId":"LLD-61045de91faef1a0-s1","entry":{"id":"review-113d07c43a028815f29fc9639cbdf449","actor":{"id":"insrc:review","kind":"system","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:55:42.885Z","operation":"review","outcome":{"result":"block","summary":"review: block","data":{"kind":"review","report":{"artifact":"design.story","stage":"design.story","verdict":"block","findings":[{"claimId":"fix-targets-defect.1","ref":"fix-targets-defect","item":"fix-targets-defect","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Transactional file/repository indexes, startup backfill, and first-match readiness reads address the ISSUE's complete fix intent.","evidence":"ISSUE.md requires scoped reads without unrelated-row scans, maintenance on every write/delete, migration without reindexing, and nonempty checks without materialization. entities.ts currently scans entity.getRange in both scoped reads and collectors; scope.ts and invariants.ts materialize repository entities only to check length. The proposed changes cover these causes. [files: docs/standalone/graph-store-has-no-index-entities-E2026101061045de9/ISSUE.md, src/db/entities.ts, src/analyze/context/scope.ts, src/analyze/context/invariants.ts]","action":"Implement the stated indexing, mutation, migration, and readiness contracts together.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"current-behaviour.1","ref":"current-behaviour","item":"current-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Current scoped reads scan authoritative entities, while schema 5 already supports dupsort indexes and atomic migration steps.","evidence":"listEntitiesForRepo, listEntityFilesForRepo, and findEntitiesByFile each iterate 'store.entity.getRange()'. store.ts declares 'SCHEMA_VERSION = 5' and opens name_index with dupSort. runMigrations executes step.run and the schema-version write inside 'store.root.childTransaction'. Startup closes the store and rethrows migration failures. [files: src/db/entities.ts, src/db/graph/store.ts, src/db/graph/migrations.ts]","action":"Reuse the existing child-transaction migration mechanism.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"change-sites.1","ref":"change-sites","item":"change-sites","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The identified production files cover authoritative entity mutations and the readiness/freshness changes.","evidence":"A production-wide entity.put/remove search found writes only in entities.ts and graph/migrations.ts. Reads of the relevant function bodies confirmed upsert, reindex, embedding update, and detach-delete paths. repos.ts delegates its entity cascade to deleteEntitiesForRepo. Both readiness seams and freshness.ts's direct scan are identified by the design. Analyzer drill-down was attempted but failed with shaper-llm-unavailable; direct reads supplied this evidence. [files: src/db/entities.ts, src/db/repos.ts, src/db/graph/migrations.ts, src/analyze/context/scope.ts, src/analyze/context/invariants.ts, src/workflow/code-review/freshness.ts]","action":"Include the reindex unchanged-row guard when implementing move reconciliation, and retain reserved shared-module rows during backfill.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"change-sites.2","ref":"change-sites","item":"change-sites","kind":"semantic","severity":"MED","premise":"The change-site inventory is complete for the schema-version bump.","evidence":"Existing tests outside the inventory hard-code schema 5. doc-summary-carry.test.ts asserts 'assert.equal(SCHEMA_VERSION, 5)' and the reopened version equals 5; migration-v4-to-v5.test.ts and operational.test.ts also assert SCHEMA_VERSION equals 5. The proposed bump will fail these tests even with correct indexing. [files: src/db/__tests__/doc-summary-carry.test.ts, src/db/graph/__tests__/migration-v4-to-v5.test.ts, src/db/graph/__tests__/operational.test.ts]","action":"Add these test files to the change sites; update current-version assertions while retaining explicit historical v4/v5 migration fixtures.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"does-not-hold"},{"claimId":"preserved-behaviour.1","ref":"preserved-behaviour","item":"preserved-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Exact path equality, ordered results, grouped-file exclusions, and strict registration are existing behaviors compatible with the proposed indexes.","evidence":"findEntitiesByFile compares 'toAbsolutePath(row.filePath, repoPath) !== file'; that helper preserves absolute paths and otherwise concatenates the repository root. Entity keys use big-endian u64 ordering. listEntityFilesForRepo skips empty filePath rows and groups string IDs in iteration order. upsertEntities and reindexFile throw UnregisteredRepoError for missing workspace registration; upsert also preserves reserved shared-module handling. [files: src/db/entities.ts, src/db/graph/keys.ts]","action":"Hash the exact existing representation, preserve empty-file exclusions and reserved repositories, and sort dupsort values by the same big-endian u64 encoding.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"tests.1","ref":"tests","item":"tests","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The proposed tests distinguish each acceptance criterion from the unfixed implementation.","evidence":"Against the actual scan loops, the proposed throwing entity.getRange spy would fail ac1/ac2; mutation membership and rollback assertions exercise ac3; populated-v5 backfill/retry assertions exercise ac4; asserting limit:1 and authoritative-row read counts distinguishes ac5 from the current full-list readiness calls. Existing entity-files-for-repo tests provide registered-repository, shared-path isolation, and unknown-repository fixtures. [files: src/db/entities.ts, src/db/__tests__/entity-files-for-repo.test.ts, src/db/graph/migrations.ts, src/analyze/context/scope.ts, src/analyze/context/invariants.ts]","action":"Implement the mapped tests, ensuring spies are installed after setup and readiness tests exercise the real storage path as well as injectable seams.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"}],"counts":{"high":0,"med":1,"low":5,"unverified":0},"template":"design-issue","reviewedAt":"2026-10-24T13:55:42.885Z","model":"cli-codex:gpt-6.1-sol","reviewedBy":"daemon"},"resolutions":{}}}}}
